    "chunk_text": "der in to \u00feam kyninge & sette hine beuoran him; \u00fea bletsode se kining \u00d0a andswerode he him & cw\u00e6\u00f0 an hund wintra. & se cyningc hine bletsode & he eode ut. Iosep sealde his gebro\u00f0rum tun on Egypta lande on \u00feam selestan ende Ramases eal swa farao him & fedde hi & ealle his f\u00e6der hiwr\u00e6dene. So\u00f0lice hlaues w\u00e6s wana on eallum ymbhwyrftum & hungor fornam swy\u00f0ost Egypte & Chanaan & Iosep h\u00e6fde gegaderod eal \u00fe\u00e6t feoh \u00fee hi ahton & gebroht on \u00fe\u00e6s kynges madmhuse. \u00dea \u00fea heora feoh ateorade \u00fea com eall Egipta folc to Iosepe & cw\u00e6don to him, Syle us mete hlauord He andswerade heom \u00fea & cw\u00e6\u00f0, driua\u00f0 hider eower orf gif ge feoh nabban & ic eow sylle mete \u00fear & hi dydon swa & he sealde heom mete wi\u00f0 horsum & wi\u00f0 hry\u00f0erum & wi\u00f0 sceapum & wi\u00f0 assum \u00dea comon hi eft to him on \u00feam \u00e6ftran geare & cw\u00e6don, Ne hele we \u00fee hlauord \u00fe\u00e6t we nabba\u00f0 na\u00f0er.",
